From 25c12001194764ddf8b0d8eb56d29737cc4410dd Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: 4evy <git@evy.pink>
Date: Sat, 5 Sep 2026 13:00:00 +0300
Subject: tui: share alternate-screen setup

Centralize crossterm raw-mode and alternate-screen setup for ratatui commands. Restore the terminal through a cleanup guard on success, cancellation, and errors, and move arrange onto the shared runner.

